<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #262626; line-height: 1.6; padding: 24px 16px;">
  <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #171717; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Kumusta, <%= @user.first_name %>!
  </p>

  <p>
    I am currently planning the next development cycle for Pasabaya. At the same time, I am conducting a research study with my group for our coursework at the <strong>University of the Philippines Open University (UPOU)</strong> regarding the platform.
  </p>

  <p>
    Because Pasabaya is an open-source, non-profit project, our roadmap isn’t driven by ads, investors, or profit targets. It is shaped entirely by what actually works for people dealing with the daily commute.
  </p>

  <p>
    We want to learn about your real experience — from how easy it is to find, post, or manage rides, to ride updates, website speed, and platform safety.
  </p>

  <p>
    To help both our academic research and the future of Pasabaya, we have prepared a short survey (about 8–10 minutes):
  </p>

  <p style="margin: 28px 0; text-align: center;">
    <%= link_to "👉 Take the Pasabaya Survey", @survey_url, style: "display: inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;" %>
  </p>

  <div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #525252; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;">
    <strong>A quick note on privacy:</strong> Your participation is completely voluntary. Responses are collected anonymously and will be used strictly for academic coursework and prioritizing upcoming platform improvements.
  </div>

  <p>
    Have specific thoughts that the form doesn’t cover, or prefer to chat directly?<br>
    💬 <%= link_to "Message us on Facebook", @facebook_url, style: "color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;" %>
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you so much for your time and for supporting Pasabaya and our studies.
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
    Thank you for sharing the road,<br>
    <strong>Artem</strong><br>
    <span style="color: #525252;">Founder of Pasabaya.app &amp; UPOU Student</span>
  </p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;">

  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #737373; margin: 0;">
    You received this email because you signed up on <a href="https://pasabaya.app" style="color: #737373; text-decoration: underline;">https://pasabaya.app</a>.
  </p>
</div>
